cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Squeak in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "Squeak: a desktop app for manual scoring of rodent object exploration"
abstract: >
  Squeak is an open-source, cross-platform desktop application for manual
  scoring of rodent behavioral assays involving object exploration, including
  the Novel Object Recognition task and Y-maze object exploration. It supports
  live webcam input, video file playback, and configurable hotkey-based
  scoring of an arbitrary number of objects, and produces per-trial CSV
  outputs and aggregated session sheets, including the Discrimination Index.
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-05-15"
license: MIT
